    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes estate Agents are delighted to offer this stunning Dual-Cottage Property For Sale. Nestled in the tranquil countryside on the slopes of the Sliabh an Iarainn mountain on a site of 2.24 acres with breath-taking panoramic views, this unique property features two cottages offering both character and comfort. Ideal for those seeking a peaceful retreat, investment opportunity, or a charming family residence.\r\nThe rustic, original cottage, full of old-world charm, features a compact kitchen, living room, shower room, and 2 cosy bedrooms.  Modest, and yet, peaceful, perfect for restful nights. Second residence- modernised cottage, fully renovated in 2021, bringing it up  to newer standards, features an open-plan living room & kitchen, modern bathroom, 2 bright bedrooms up the stairs, with countryside views. Both properties include classic charming features like vintage doors, timeless woodwork, and a warm atmosphere. Situated midway between the towns of Ballinamore & Drumshanbo (approx 10km). Nature enthusiasts will appreciate Poll an Easa Waterfall, only 4.3 km walk away.  Viewing Strictly by Appointment Only with Sole Selling Agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Original cottage: \r\nKitchen/Dining room with solid fuel heating\r\nShower room\r\nLiving room\r\n2 smaller bedrooms\r\nStorage space in the attic.\r\n\r\nRenovated cottage:\r\nOpen plan kitchen / spacious living room solid fuel stove\r\nShower room\r\n2 bright bedrooms up stairs"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Original cottage with rustic features, built in 1899.\r\nConverted stone old house, renovated in 2021.\r\nLarge Glass Façade  - floods the space with natural light and scenic views\r\nStone outbuildings\r\nSolid Fuel Stove\r\nGarden views"
      },
